>
  <p>Modern Men's Fitness is run by Jordan Hoppel in Scottsdale, Arizona. The best way to reach us is email:</p>
  <p style="font-size:1.25rem;"><a href="mailto:jordan@modernmensfitness.com"><strong>jordan@modernmensfitness.com</strong></a></p>

  <h2>What to write to us about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> If you find a mistake in a table, calculator or article, send the page address and what looks wrong. We check every report and fix errors. See the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial and data policy</a> for how we handle corrections.</li>
    <li><strong>Questions about a calculator or a standards table.</strong> Tell us what you entered and what you expected.</li>
    <li><strong>Press and business enquiries.</strong></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Looking for the program or coaching?</h2>
  <p>The Primal Press Protocol, a 12 week bench press program, is on its own site: <a href="https://primalpressprotocol.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">primalpressprotocol.com</a>. Questions about an order or your access go there.</p>

  <h2>Medical questions</h2>
  <p>We cannot give medical advice by email. For injuries, health conditions or nutrition questions that depend on your health, please talk to a doctor, physical therapist or registered dietitian.</p>

  <h2>About the site</h2>
  <p>Read more about <a href="/about-jordan-hoppel/">Jordan Hoppel</a>, how the site works in the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial and data policy</a>, and how it handles information in the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
